    <DemoExample Title="Style & Class" RazorCode="@example26RazorCode" Id="example26">
        <div>
            <b>Style</b> and <b>Class</b> land on the root element. For anything deeper, <b>Styles</b> and
            <b>Classes</b> reach the individual parts - the browse button, the description, the file list, each item,
